Summary of major modifications in this fork:
  1. Removed the OneBot v11 protocol adapter to focus exclusively on the Milky protocol.
  2. Aligned Milky events, segments, and API payloads with the official Milky v1 specification, and added capability-token media proxy downloading.
  3. Replaced the legacy static web pages with a newly implemented monochrome WebUI console featuring QR/quick login, runtime metrics, live SSE log streaming, and an interactive Milky API debugger.
  4. Updated Docker packaging and bundled Linux NTQQ version configuration.
